{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103634","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103634/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103634/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103634/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103634","id":2897545907,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6stQqz","number":103634,"title":"Gridmap error spam when regenerating MeshLibrary","user":{"login":"DevPoodle","id":102482062,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhvAjg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102482062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle","html_url":"https://github.com/DevPoodle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DevPoodle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-03-05T14:49:13Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T19:38:30Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nI've had this issue in 4.4. and 4.3. I think I remember it happening even earlier, but I haven't recently tested any earlier versions.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you do `Scene > Export As > MeshLibrary...` and overwrite a mesh library currently being used by a gridmap in an open scene, then you get a bunch of this error: \n\n`ERROR: servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/mesh_storage.cpp:667 - Parameter \"mesh\" is null.`\n\nIf you check \"Merge with existing\" then you get one of this error, but if don't check it, you get the error for at least as many meshes as are in the library. This can be quite annoying when using gridmaps with a couple dozen different tiles. To be clear, the errors don't cause any actual issue with exporting the mesh library or using the gridmap.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In the MRP, make sure the `example` scene and `grid_tiles` scene are open. \n2. In the `grid_tiles` scene, go to the top-left and do `Scene > Export As > MeshLibrary...` Overwrite the already existing `grid_tiles.meshlib`. \n\nIf you don't check the \"Merge with Existing\" box, then you should get 6 of the provided error. If you do check it, you should only get 1.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gridmap_error_spam.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19091115/gridmap_error_spam.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103634/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103634/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}